y&#39;re the most important people in my life.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5835648099765820263/comments/default/3372303151113579257'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5835648099765820263/comments/default/3372303151113579257'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/06/martial-law-license-to-loot-permit-to.html?showComment=1214618580000#c3372303151113579257' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/06/martial-law-license-to-loot-permit-to.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5835648099765820263' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5835648099765820263' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 27, 2008 at 8:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8861167374184724862</id><published>2008-06-26T10:38:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-06-26T10:38:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>That was a brilliantly written article.</title><content type='html'>That was a brilliantly written article.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5835648099765820263/comments/default/8861167374184724862'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5835648099765820263/comments/default/8861167374184724862'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedo